{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01572","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第六拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第六拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪得春光不来久，胡中风土无花柳。\n天翻地覆谁得知，如今正南看北斗。\n姓名音信两不通，终日经年常闭口。\n是非取与在指撝，言语传情不如手。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}